      "side": 0,
      "message": "Thanks Michael. I had also thought about Dawn push constants. I discussed it with my teammate Shaobo, who is currently working on it. Natively D3D11 doesn\u0027t have push constants support. Even we could emulate it with constant buffers, the performance wouldn\u0027t be optimal. So I made this attempting CL. With it, the GPU percentage can drop from 20% to 10% for the simple \"draw_image.html\" case.\n\nIt makes sense to leave things as-is for now, and revisit it afterward. I am okay either way.",
